AUTHORS — Bogodroid (this fork)

This file credits the substantial contributors to this Bogodroid fork.
Per-commit attribution lives in `git log`; this list focuses on people
who shaped major subsystems.

Maintainer / fork lead
----------------------
jenny92-tech <jennyliu90223@gmail.com>
  Owns this fork (https://github.com/jenny92-tech/Bogodroid).
  Major work: Docker cross-compile pipeline, OpenSL ES shim,
  Android input backend, GLES2 thunk overrides, libc font-path
  redirect, javastubs for Hollow Knight + Black Myth boot,
  unityloader startup orchestration.

Upstream — Bogodroid NEO
------------------------
binarycounter and the upstream Bogodroid NEO contributors.
  Original framework and the `neo` branch this fork tracks:
  https://github.com/binarycounter/Bogodroid

Upstream — predecessors
-----------------------
JohnnyOnFlame <https://github.com/JohnnyonFlame>
  Author of gmloader-net; Bogodroid is heavily derived from it.

ChristopherHX <https://github.com/ChristopherHX>
  Author of libjnivm (MIT), bundled as a submodule.

Notes
-----
- Bogodroid as a whole is GPL v3 (see LICENSE.md).
- libjnivm and tomlplusplus submodules retain their own MIT licenses.
- Bundled CJK fallback font in HK port (DroidSansFallback.ttf) is
  Apache 2.0; see the LICENSE next to the font for full text.
- This file is not exhaustive — `git log --pretty=format:"%an"` is
  authoritative for code authorship at the line/commit level.
